    },
    "reproduce": "The captured pixels are the served build's public/index.html, app.js and style.css (hashes in environment). To shoot the after state of an edit in this worktree, serve THIS worktree on a free port with its own PANEL_CONFIG (public/ is read per request; lib/ needs a restart) and follow the same steps at the same viewport. The 340x520 surfaceFile depends only on the public files, not on the live board behind the window.",
    "scope": "The whole Settings window (#settings): its head, search box, tab strip and the visible General panel. Hidden tabs are not painted and are excluded."
  },
